NO MODEL WEIGHTS ARE REDISTRIBUTED
----------------------------------

This repository contains no model weights, no container images, and no vendored
wheels. Everything under models/ and vendor/ is excluded by .gitignore, with two
deliberate exceptions -- models/MANIFEST.json and models/README.md -- neither of
which contains any part of a model.

All artefacts are fetched from their upstream publishers during provisioning at
pinned revisions and recorded by sha256 in MANIFEST.json. Licence obligations
attach to the party performing that download.


